            "data": {
                "text": "## 2. Assembly, binning and MAG selection\n\nThe main MAG workflow assembles the short reads (metaSPAdes may additionally use the long reads), bins the contigs with the enabled binners, refines and dereplicates the bins, and reports MAG quality and abundance. Choose the grouping, binning and refinement settings that match your experiment."
