            "data": {
                "text": "## 3. MAG annotation\n\nThree optional annotation workflows run on the dereplicated MAGs: taxonomic classification (GTDB-Tk and kMetaShot), genome annotation (plasmids, integrons, insertion sequences, antimicrobial resistance genes, Bakta) and functional annotation (eggNOG-mapper, InterProScan, KEGG). Set each to *No* to skip it. The databases must be available on the Galaxy server."
            }
        },
