                                    "data": {
                                        "text": "## Select original or grouped reads\n\nThe two selector steps enable original reads, metadata-based grouping, or both for hybrid mode. Fastq groupmerge merges reads using the chosen metadata column. Optional bridges and collection merging combine the selected branches; null filtering removes skipped placeholders. Paired reads are flattened and re-paired without changing mate relationships."
                                    }
